      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>This is the reshut “Yareti” by Yequtiel bar Mosheh (known from the acrostic signature), as translated into rhymed English verse by Elsie Davis, and published in Herbert Adler and Arthur Davis’s <tei:hi rend="italic">Maḥzor Avodat Ohel Moed: Avodat Yom haZikaron</tei:hi> (1907), pp. 95-96. This reshut is offered by the shaliaḥ tsibbur at the outset of their repetition of the Amidah for shaḥarit on Rosh haShanah in the Ashkenazi nusaḥ, minhag Polin.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
